back we go to World War one to see operatic star&nbsp;
Madame Schumann hike at Palo Alto California who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:11.730
arrives to entertain our soldiers the singer&nbsp;
who made her debut at the Metropolitan Opera&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:16.320
in 1899 thrills American doughboys with&nbsp;
her rendition of our National Anthem

